  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<h1 align=\"center\">dsh-pgragh</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>A live parallel execution line for DeepSeek Harness Web.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh/actions/workflows/ci.yml\"><img alt=\"CI\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh/ci.yml?style=flat-square&label=tests\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-pgragh\"><img alt=\"npm\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/dsh-pgragh?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness\"><img alt=\"DeepSeek Harness\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DeepSeek_Harness-plugin-475569?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img alt=\"MIT\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh?style=flat-square\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "dsh-pgragh adds one compact white line above the [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) composer. Every point comes from a real tool dispatch, physical completion, and ordered session commit, so you can see whether parallel work happened, where it waited, and how much wall time it saved.\n\n```text\nmodel emits:    A  B  C  D\ncompletion:     B  A  C  D\nordered commit: A  B  C  D\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires DeepSeek Harness and Node.js `22.19+` or `24+`.\n\n```bash\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-pgragh@0.1.0\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\nOpen a conversation and run more than one tool in a step. The line appears automatically and stays hidden when there are no calls. A source install is also supported:\n\n```bash\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Read the line",
      "text": "- **Position and state:** point position is physical completion time; a hollow pulse is running, a double outline is completed but waiting for ordered commit, and a solid point is committed. Hover for the tool label, duration, and commit wait.\n- **Call type:** an outer ring marks a subagent, a small point marks a code-mode internal call, and a diamond marks an exclusive barrier. `T17 · S4` identifies the active turn and step.\n- **Savings:** `Parallelism = serial leaf-work estimate / wall time`; `Saved = serial estimate - wall time`. Parent `run_code` calls are excluded when their internal calls are visible, preventing double counting."
    },
    {
      "section": "Ground truth and limits",
      "text": "The host observes the official `tools/execute` around-dispatch path for start and completion timestamps. Persisted `tool/result` and `tool/code-dispatch` session events determine when results become model-visible. The observer is read-only: it does not change arguments, results, scheduler behavior, or commit order."
    },
    {
      "section": "Ground truth and limits",
      "text": "The SSE feed contains only session id, tool name, optional description, status, and timestamps. The UI shows the latest observed step; its in-memory timeline starts again when the DSH host restarts."
    },
    {
      "section": "Verification",
      "text": "`pnpm check` runs strict type checking, both host and browser builds, state-machine and metrics tests, plus a real DSH integration test using the official `ToolRuntime`, `SessionStore`, and `WebServer`.\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm check\n```\n\nFocused issues and pull requests are welcome. Keep the observer read-only and include behavioral tests for timeline changes."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © dsh-pgragh contributors"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<h1 align=\"center\">dsh-pgragh</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><strong>DeepSeek Harness Web 的实时并行执行线。</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"README.md\">English</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh/actions/workflows/ci.yml\"><img alt=\"CI\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh/ci.yml?style=flat-square&label=tests\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-pgragh\"><img alt=\"npm\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/dsh-pgragh?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness\"><img alt=\"DeepSeek Harness\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DeepSeek_Harness-plugin-475569?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img alt=\"MIT\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh?style=flat-square\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "dsh-pgragh 在 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 输入框上方加入一条简洁的白色执行线。每个点都来自真实的工具 dispatch、物理完成和有序 session commit，让你直接看见并行是否发生、结果在哪里等待，以及实际节省了多少 wall time。\n\n```text\n模型发出： A  B  C  D\n物理完成： B  A  C  D\n有序提交： A  B  C  D\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "需要 DeepSeek Harness，以及 Node.js `22.19+` 或 `24+`。\n\n```bash\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-pgragh@0.1.0\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\n打开会话并在同一步运行多个工具。存在调用时执行线自动出现，没有调用时自动隐藏。也可以直接从源码安装：\n\n```bash\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:dangoZhang/dsh-pgragh\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "怎么读",
      "text": "- **位置与状态：** 点的位置对应物理完成时间；呼吸空心点正在运行，双轮廓点已完成但仍在等待 ordered commit，实心点已经提交。悬停可查看工具标签、执行耗时和 commit wait。\n- **调用类型：** 外环表示 subagent，小点表示 code-mode internal call，菱形表示 exclusive barrier；`T17 · S4` 标记当前 Turn 和 Step。\n- **节省时间：** `Parallelism = 叶子工作串行估算 / wall time`，`Saved = 串行估算 - wall time`。内部调用可见时不重复计算外层 `run_code`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据依据与限制",
      "text": "Host 在官方 `tools/execute` around-dispatch 路径记录开始与完成时间；持久化的 `tool/result` 和 `tool/code-dispatch` session 事件决定结果何时对模型可见。观察器只读，不改变参数、结果、scheduler 行为或 commit 顺序。\n\nSSE 只发送 session id、工具名、可选描述、状态和时间戳。界面展示最近一次观测到的 Step；DSH Host 重启后，内存中的时间线会重新开始。"
    },
    {
      "section": "验证",
      "text": "`pnpm check` 会运行严格类型检查、Host 与浏览器构建、状态机和指标测试，以及使用官方 `ToolRuntime`、`SessionStore`、`WebServer` 的真实 DSH 集成测试。\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm check\n```\n\n欢迎提交聚焦的问题和 Pull Request。观察器必须保持只读，时间线行为变更需要对应测试。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © dsh-pgragh contributors"
    }
  ],
